+    /*
+     * patch 0007: exchange the extension only when BOTH ends advertise it.
+     * Doing it after the base exchange (rather than piggybacked on the first
+     * send) means a pre-0007 peer never sees an unexpected byte, so send mode
+     * against an old plugin is bit-identical to the unpatched wire.
