+/*
+ * Has the receiver published the slot this connection is waiting for?
+ *
+ * 1 = yes (slot copied out), 0 = not yet, -1 = the ring has been overrun,
+ * which cannot happen while depth >= NCCL_NET_MAX_REQUESTS and is therefore
+ * reported as an error rather than papered over.
